-- 1165: Blog post - "Building a Hydroponic System From Scratch: Inside Our
--       13 December 2025 Practical Session"
--
--       Third post for WSQ - Basic Urban Farming with Hydroponics (TGS-2025053916),
--       after 1162 (6 Jun 2026 class) and 1163 (11 Oct 2025 melon post). This one is
--       the step-by-step kit build: soak sponges -> seat net pots -> mix + measure
--       solution -> mount the 8-site lid. Cross-links to both siblings.
--       Ships already published (status 1); linkedin_urn carries the manual-skip
--       sentinel so publishDue / the share cron never pick it up.
--       published_at is pinned to 2025-12-13 (the class date), NOT CURDATE().
--
-- Every course figure below was read off the LIVE course page on 2026-08-29:
--   * Fee card: full $350.00, GST $31.50 (9%), baseline nett $206.50 (SG/PR 21+, 50%),
--     MCES/SME nett $136.50 (SG 40+, 70%).
--   * Course information: 1 day / 8 hrs, Beginner, 1 hr assessment.
--   * Venue: MEOD Farm, 13 Neo Tiew Harvest Lane, Singapore 719838.
--   * Funding validity 24 Mar 2025 - 23 Mar 2027.
--   * TSC: Urban Farming Implementation and Management Control (AGR-FOP-2002-1.1).
--
-- Class photographs supplied by the academy, cropped to landscape and uploaded to R2
-- under blog/hydroponics/2025-12-13-* (all verified HTTP 200). Embedded as <figure
-- class="mmd-blog-figure"> with credit in the figcaption.
--
-- The meter photo shows a microsiemens (EC) reading, so the body describes it as a
-- conductivity reading on a combo pH/EC meter rather than claiming a pH value the
-- photo does not show. The 5.5-6.5 pH band is stated as the general crop target,
-- not as a reading from this session.
--
-- Notes for future editors:
--  * apply.php splits statements on ";" at end-of-line - the content HTML is ONE line.
--  * Content is pure ASCII (em-dashes etc. as HTML entities) - see
--    feedback_migration_applyphp_utf8_outage.
--  * `excerpt` uses a REAL em-dash via CHAR() (plain-text reuse; see 1161), and
--    `meta_description` deliberately contains NO em-dash entity (see 1164 - the
--    escaper double-escapes it into og:/twitter: tags).
--  * FAQ ships as native <details> accordions per the blog-pipeline rules.
--  * Idempotent: WHERE NOT EXISTS on url_key, INSERT IGNORE on tag links.
--  * SG-only guard via @mms_instance - the CTA course is SG WSQ, absent on MY/GH.
